            202060008
          ]
        },
        "202060005": {
          "id": 202060005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "무슨 일이에요?",
          "next": [
            202060008
          ]
        },
        "202060006": {
          "id": 202060006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "궁금하니까 어서 말해 봐요",
          "next": [
            202060007
          ]
        },
        "202060007": {
          "id": 202060007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "왜 그래요?",
          "next": [
            202060008
          ]
        },
        "202060008": {
          "id": 202060008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "음… 최근에 드디어 한가해졌는데, 가만히 있질 못 하겠어서 뭐라도 할 일을 찾고 있어요",
          "next": [
            202060009
          ]
        },
        "202060009": {
          "id": 202060009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "아글라이아, 트리비 선생님은 모두 자신만의 전문 분야가 있잖아요",
          "next": [
            202060010
          ]
        },
        "202060010": {
          "id": 202060010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "흥이 난 김에 여러 직업을 체험해 보고 새로운 스킬도 배우면서 제 취미도 더 많이 찾고 싶어졌죠!",
          "next": [
            202060011
          ]
        },
        "202060011": {
          "id": 202060011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "그래서 요리사, 열쇠공, 귀신의 집 연기자, 의상 모델, 드로마스 기수, 경매사에 지원해 봤는데……",
          "next": [
            202060012
          ]
        },
        "202060012": {
          "id": 202060012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "영 입맛에 안 맞더라고요……",
          "next": [
            202060013
          ]
        },
        "202060013": {
          "id": 202060013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "파트너, 다른 추천할 만한 거 있어요?",
          "next": [
            202060014,
            202060016,
            202060018
          ]
        },
        "202060014": {
          "id": 202060014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "결국엔 떠오를 뜨거운 태양——",
          "next": [
            202060015
          ]
        },
        "202060015": {
          "id": 202060015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "당신은 하늘을 날며 유람해야 해요!",
          "next": [
            202060019
          ]
        },
        "202060016": {
          "id": 202060016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "수채화가는 색채 조합 능력을 향상시킬 수 있어요",
          "next": [
            202060017
          ]
        },
        "202060017": {
          "id": 202060017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "꽤 도전적 아닌가요?",
          "next": [
            202060019
          ]
        },
        "202060018": {
          "id": 202060018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "강아지 훈련사요. 당신은 그쪽으로 재능이 뛰어날 거예요",
          "next": [
            202060019
          ]
        },
        "202060019": {
          "id": 202060019,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "next": [
            202060020
          ]
        },
        "202060020": {
          "id": 202060020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "당신은 저한테 영감을 줬어요!",
          "next": [
            202060021
          ]
        },
        "202060021": {
          "id": 202060021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "시야를 넓혀서 하늘과 땅을 넘나드는 더 많은 도전을 받아들여야겠네요",
          "next": [
            202060022
          ]
        },
        "202060022": {
          "id": 202060022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "스카이다이빙 같은 거 있잖아요. 전 높은 곳을 두려워하지 않고 심지어 더 높이 올라갈 수도 있죠",
          "next": [
            202060023
          ]
        },
        "202060023": {
          "id": 202060023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "그리고… 구기 종목 운동선수는 어떨 것 같아요?",
          "next": [
            202060024
          ]
        },
        "202060024": {
          "id": 202060024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "제가 득점하는 걸 보면, 재능이 좀 있는 것 같거든요",
          "next": [
            202060025
          ]
        },
        "202060025": {
          "id": 202060025,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "next": [
            202060026
          ]
        },
        "202060026": {
          "id": 202060026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "괜찮은 것 같아요!",
          "next": [
            202060027
          ]
        },
        "202060027": {
          "id": 202060027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1408,
          "text": "생각할수록 신나네요!",
          "next": [
            202060028
